    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -680,
        "y": -300
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Watkins (PhD thesis, Cambridge 1989) introduced Q-learning: learn the value Q(s, a) of each action from r + gamma max Q(s', a'), and act greedily on it. This graph runs it on the 4x4 gridworld of Sutton and Barto's textbook, with a small network in place of the table (the DQN recipe of Mnih et al. 2013). The agent starts top-left; the goal bottom-right pays 1, the traps at (1,1) and (2,3) pay -1, every other step pays 0. Recipe: DQN hidden 32, Adam at lr 0.001, gamma 0.9, 300 episodes, epsilon 1.0 to 0.05 over 100 episodes. With run seed 0 on CPU training takes 0.8 s, and the trained policy reaches the goal in 10 of 10 rollouts, each in 6 steps, the shortest path.\n\nWatkins（劍橋大學博士論文，1989）提出 Q-learning：用 r + gamma max Q(s', a') 學每個動作的價值 Q(s, a)，再依它選最好的動作。這張圖在 Sutton 與 Barto 教科書裡的 4x4 網格世界上執行，用小網路取代表格（Mnih 等人 2013 年的 DQN 做法）。agent 從左上角出發；右下角的終點給 1 分，(1,1) 和 (2,3) 的陷阱給 -1 分，其他步給 0 分。配方：DQN hidden 32、Adam lr 0.001、gamma 0.9、300 回合、epsilon 在 100 回合內從 1.0 降到 0.05。run seed 0、CPU 上訓練花 0.8 秒，訓練後的策略在 10 次 rollout 中 10 次抵達終點，每次都走 6 步，也就是最短路徑。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-model",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 560
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The observation is a one-hot vector of the 16 cells, so state_dim is 16; the 4 outputs are the Q-values of up, right, down and left.\n\n觀測值是 16 格的 one-hot 向量，所以 state_dim 是 16；4 個輸出分別是上、右、下、左的 Q 值。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "model",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 300
        },
        "noteWidth": 280
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-loop",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 720,
        "y": 700
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "gamma 0.9 makes a goal reached sooner worth more (0.9 per extra step), which is what teaches the shortest path; with gamma 0.99 the same run still reaches the goal but wanders. The reward is sparse, so learning_starts 200 and a 100-episode epsilon decay give the replay buffer enough episodes that end at the goal. Over seeds 1 to 3 the rollouts reach the goal every time, in 6 steps.\n\ngamma 0.9 讓越早抵達終點越值錢（每多一步乘 0.9），策略就是這樣學到最短路徑；gamma 改成 0.99 時同樣能抵達終點，但會繞路。獎勵很稀疏，所以 learning_starts 200 和 100 回合的 epsilon 衰減讓 replay buffer 先收集到足夠多抵達終點的回合。seed 1 到 3 的 rollout 每次都走 6 步抵達終點。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "loop",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 1000
        },
        "noteWidth": 320
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-rollout",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 1080,
        "y": -580
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "PolicyRollout plays the trained network 10 times at temperature 0.01, close to always taking the best action. success_rate is the share that reached the goal.\n\nPolicyRollout 用訓練好的網路玩 10 次，temperature 0.01 幾乎總是選最好的動作。success_rate 是抵達終點的比例。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "rollout",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -280
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    }
